Subject: [PATCH 2/5] EDA-06, EDA-04: clustering, PCA and the cleaning working
 view

- ClusteringParams/PcaParams with bounded, typed parameters and a fixed seed
- K-means and PCA via scikit-learn: complete-row handling, fail-closed input errors,
  reproducible results (threads pinned), warnings for excluded rows, constant and
  unscaled columns
- CleaningPlan (drop_duplicates, drop_missing_rows, impute) applied to a copy; log recorded in
  Provenance.cleaning; execute_plan_on_view
- threadpoolctl declared as a dependency; mypy override for untyped sklearn
